	5.	build normalization
	6.	build topology layer
	7.	build context assembly
	8.	build playbook engine
	9.	build capacity playbooks
	10.	build resilience posture playbooks
	11.	build resilience validation playbooks
	12.	build cross-domain playbooks
	13.	build reporting APIs
	14.	harden for production

