5. What You Should Not Do

Do not start with UI.
Do not start with ML.
Do not start with dashboards.
Do not hardcode decisions into connectors.
Do not treat playbooks as static threshold files.
Do not ignore upstream/downstream context.
Do not publish findings without evidence objects.

